      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“阿米巴不会死亡。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Amoebas do not die.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那是美丽的象征哟。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is a beautiful symbol, you know.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "没有父母亲，就没有孩子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Without parents, there are no children.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "既没有男的，也没有女的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There are neither males nor females.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "既没有哥哥，也没有弟弟。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There are neither elder brothers nor younger brothers.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "丈夫披着睡衣，他把散发着来苏水味的手伸到夫人面前。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her husband, draped in his nightclothes, held out his hand, smelling of Lysol, before his wife.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p02030",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "夫人解开腰带，一边递给他，一边说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His wife untied her sash and, as she handed it to him, said:",
          "g": "predicate"
